EXCLUDED_AND_REPAIR_NOTES

- The initial sparse oracle attempt failed because its 33-support dense-fallback fixture placed a zero-count winner row outside active rows; the old materializer correctly rejected it. The failure is preserved in sparse_m_commit_matches_legacy_for_kzg_and_ipa.log. A pre-contract-fix retry passed after making that fixture row valid, but that retry is not final equivalence evidence.
